1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,010
(Raj:)If you're really
Nathan Fillion,

2
00:00:03,009 --> 00:00:06,109
what's the line from Firefly
about your bonnet?

3
00:00:07,447 --> 00:00:09,847
"I swear by my pretty floral
bonnet, I will end you."

4
00:00:12,085 --> 00:00:13,585
(Penny:)That's it,
that's the line.

5
00:00:13,586 --> 00:00:15,586
(Raj:)Although...

6
00:00:15,588 --> 00:00:18,358
(Raj:)I knew the line--
doesn't make me Nathan Fillion.

7
00:00:19,492 --> 00:00:21,762
(Nathan Fillion:)Do you want the picture or not?

8
00:00:21,761 --> 00:00:24,591
(Raj:)I want a picture
with Nathan Fillion.

9
00:00:24,597 --> 00:00:27,937
(Nathan:)How about a picture with a guy
who looks like Nathan Fillion

10
00:00:27,934 --> 00:00:31,234
(Nathan:)but a little more annoyed
than Nathan Fillion usually is?

11
00:00:33,773 --> 00:00:34,873
(Leonard:)What do you think?

12
00:00:36,175 --> 00:00:37,575
Eh, it's good enough
for Facebook.

13
00:00:45,551 --> 00:00:47,121
(Penny:)I can't believe
they did that.

14
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,120
(Penny:)I know-- it's so insulting.

15
00:00:49,122 --> 00:00:50,792
(Penny:)At one point,
they had me figure out

16
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:53,760
(Penny:)how to get a banana
out of a puzzle box.

17
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:56,760
(Leonard:)Wait, Sheldon gave me
a banana in a box.

18
00:00:56,763 --> 00:00:58,963
(Leonard:)He was testing me, too.

19
00:00:58,965 --> 00:01:00,965
(Penny:)Unbelievable.

